    "url": "/api/v2/item-category/55/"
  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ダイヤ柄が　オシャレな　テーブルクロス。防水　防カビ　性能に　優れ汚れも　ひと拭きで　落ちる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "세련된 다이아 무늬의 테이블보. 방수와 방미 성능이 뛰어나서 더러워져도 한 번 쓱 닦으면 깨끗해진다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "擁有時尚菱狀花紋的桌巾。防水和防霉性能非常卓越，髒汙也能輕易地擦拭乾淨。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une nappe avec un élégant motif à losanges. Elle est hydrophobe, anti-moisissures, et il suffit d’un simple coup d’éponge pour y faire disparaître toutes les taches.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Dieses Tischtuch mit modischem Rautenmuster ist wunderbar wasserabweisend und schimmelfest, sodass sich Schmutz und Flecken leicht wegwischen lassen.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un mantel con un original diseño a rombos. Es resistente al agua y al moho, por lo que es muy fácil de limpiar.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tovaglia dall’elegante motivo a rombi. Impermeabile e a prova di muffa, per pulirla basta una passata di spugna.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A tablecloth with a fashionable diamond pattern. It’s great at repelling water and mold, and stains and smudges wipe right off.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ダイヤ柄が　オシャレな　テーブルクロス。防水　防カビ　性能に　優れ汚れも　ひと拭きで　落ちる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "带有菱纹图案的时尚桌巾。既防水又防霉，性能优越。弄脏了也一下就能擦掉。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
